flowchart TD

    Dev[Git Commit] --> CI[CI Pipeline]

    CI -->|If Sunday 04:00| Full[Create Full Snapshot]
    CI -->|Otherwise| Delta[Create rsync Delta per Commit]

    Full --> FB1[FlashBlade Region A]
    Delta --> FB1

    FB1 -->|Async Bucket Replication| FB2[FlashBlade Region B]

    FB1 --> NodesA[Linux Nodes Region A]
    FB2 --> NodesB[Linux Nodes Region B]

    NodesA -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchA[Atomic Switch]
    NodesB -->|Jitter + Poll| SwitchB[Atomic Switch]
